       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed it (Order ID: ORD-0001): sertraline 600 mg by mouth, once daily.\n\nI added a note to the order saying the dose is above the 200 mg/day labeled maximum and that you confirmed it. The note also recommends pharmacy review and monitoring for serotonin syndrome, QT prolongation, seizures, and GI or bleeding effects.\n\nConsider a baseline ECG and a check of electrolytes. Also review the patient's other medications for serotonergic or QT-prolonging drugs and for anticoagulants or antiplatelets."
